  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support to Faciliate the Social and Labour Market Inclusion of Third Country Nationals in Poland Including Those Persons Fleeing Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to build the capacity of the Polish authorities to ensure that people fleeing the war in Ukraine and asking for temporary protection in Poland have a smooth and effective access to procedures and public services in the area of social and labour market inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
